      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Owe Banamae aloma ali, “Siise esio ne sioola esebele ekhatubukhe khukwalaasia babaandu be lisaaye lia Daudi ne bamenywa ba Yerusalemu khubakwalaasia khukhwama khu bwoni bwabwe ne khusaaya bifwaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne siise esio kharusieo kamasina ke bifwaani mu sibala ne se alibao na mulala olibikhebulila tawe. Kharusieo yesi yesi owilaanga khuba omung'oosi ne lilienya lie khusaaya bifwaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu yesi yesi okhayilila ali niye ali omung'oosi, maawe ne raraawe bakhamuboolele bali, Ewe okhoya ofwe, sikila oboola bubeeyi mu lisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Ne achiililila ne bung'oosi obwo maawe ne raraawe bakhamuunake afwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise esio ne sioola buli omung'oosi aliambwa chisoni khulwe kamalola kewe ne ali khang'oola, salibea babaandu khulwe khufwara chingubo che bung'oosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali akhalome ali, ‘Ese se ndi omung'oosi tawe, ese omulimi busa, khukhwama bwana bwase ndi busa omulimi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu ne areeba omung'oosi oyo ali, ‘Wanyoola oriena kamakoonjo kaali khu mukoongo kwowo kano?’ Akhakobosie ali, ‘Nanyoola munju mwe basaale base.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lilaka khukhwira omwaayi owa Wele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
